      "messages": {
        "202540000": {
          "id": 202540000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "Chat Log (4) Between \"Luck's Got a Thing for Me\" and \"Pay-Me-Back-8888\"<br><u>Pay-Me-Back-8888 (08:08)</u><br>I. Miss. You. So. Much.<br><u>Pay-Me-Back-8888 (08:08)</u><br>Think I can't recognize you just because your avatar has a hat and glasses on... heh.<br><u>Pay-Me-Back-8888 (08:18)</u><br>Did you really think thirty years was enough for all those debts to just vanish into thin air?<br><u>Pay-Me-Back-8888 (08:28)</u><br>Sure, I'm old now. Can't chase you around like I used to. But my son and my grandson? They're doing big things... Pay up, or I'm sending a whole crew after you!",
          "next": [
            202540001
          ]
        },
        "202540001": {
          "id": 202540001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "Alas, how could it ever come to this?",
          "next": [
            202540002
          ]
        },
        "202540002": {
          "id": 202540002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "If I didn't have such a sentimental attachment to this rare number ending in 8888, the one that won me eight whole months of breakfast vouchers (soy milk included)...",
          "next": [
            202540003
          ]
        },
        "202540003": {
          "id": 202540003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "Why would I go through all that trouble to buy it back?",
          "next": [
            202540004
          ]
        },
        "202540004": {
          "id": 202540004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "Never thought my old creditor would still be chasing me after all this time... Guess I really made an impression.",
          "next": [
            202540005,
            202540007
          ]
        },
        "202540005": {
          "id": 202540005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Nihilux? Weren't you being all secretive and playing the disappearing act on us?",
          "next": [
            202540008
          ]
        },
        "202540006": {
          "id": 202540006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Can't pay off your debts, can you?",
          "next": [
            202540009
          ]
        },
        "202540007": {
          "id": 202540007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Poor creditor. How many thirty-year stretches does anyone get in a lifetime?",
          "next": [
            202540010
          ]
        },
        "202540008": {
          "id": 202540008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "And here I am, sneaking around to find you again.",
          "next": [
            202540006
          ]
        },
        "202540009": {
          "id": 202540009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "Keep it a secret.",
          "next": [
            202540010
          ]
        },
        "202540010": {
          "id": 202540010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "And what debt do you think I owe this time?",
          "next": [
            202540011
          ]
        },
        "202540011": {
          "id": 202540011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "One day, I happened to wander past a tavern for the first time in ages and spotted them recruiting the \"Unluckiest Soul in the Cosmos\" to be the face of the \"Funniest Place in the Cosmos.\"",
          "next": [
            202540012
          ]
        },
        "202540012": {
          "id": 202540012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "I signed up on a whim, and wouldn't you know it, I won 888 free drinks... only to get slapped with an outrageous liquidated damages fee by that whole crowd of Fools.",
          "next": [
            202540013
          ]
        },
        "202540013": {
          "id": 202540013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "And \"Pay-Me-Back-8888\" was the bartender at the time.",
          "next": [
            202540014
          ]
        },
        "202540014": {
          "id": 202540014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "I parked in a free lot to dodge some debt collectors, and somehow, that exact same lot got awarded in a contract bid and started charging for parking...",
          "next": [
            202540015
          ]
        },
        "202540015": {
          "id": 202540015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "The contractor even changed their name to \"LicensePlate8888PayUp\" just to chase me down for thirty years' worth of parking fees on my little motorbike.",
          "next": [
            202540016
          ]
        },
        "202540016": {
          "id": 202540016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "As if anyone believes he doesn't know someone called \"Pay-Me-Back-8888\"!",
          "next": [
            202540017,
            202540018,
            202540019
          ]
        },
        "202540017": {
          "id": 202540017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Luck's got a thing for you, and it's going a little overboard!",
          "next": [
            202540020
          ]
        },
        "202540018": {
          "id": 202540018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Hard to say if 8888 is just that lucky a number, or if the Equilibrium has it out for you.",
          "next": [
            202540020
          ]
        },
        "202540019": {
          "id": 202540019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "I'm telling you, stop obsessing over \"8888\"! That number's no good for your luck!",
          "next": [
            202540020
          ]
        },
        "202540020": {
          "id": 202540020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Your friend is typing...",
          "next": [
            202540021
          ]
        },
        "202540021": {
          "id": 202540021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "Uh oh.",
          "next": [
            202540022
          ]
        },
        "202540022": {
          "id": 202540022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "Uh oh, this is bad!",
          "next": [
            202540023,
            202540024
          ]
        },
        "202540023": {
          "id": 202540023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Oh no, this is really bad.",
          "next": [
            202540025
          ]
        },
        "202540024": {
          "id": 202540024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "More debts piling up?",
          "next": [
            202540025
          ]
        },
        "202540025": {
          "id": 202540025,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "next": [
            202540026
          ]
        },
        "202540026": {
          "id": 202540026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 240,
          "text": "H—help, help me... Why is Pay-Me-Back-8888 STILL coming after me!? Did they plant a tracker on me!? And now LicensePlate8888 showed up too! I KNEW these two were in on this together!! Can't I just abandon this account!? NO MORE EIGHTS! I'm outta here!!",
          "next": [
            202540027
          ]
        },
        "202540027": {
          "id": 202540027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Voice message converted to text",
          "next": [
            202540028
          ]
        },
